182
00:30:23,430 --> 00:30:27,360
I will apply this to all modules here.

183
00:30:31,360 --> 00:30:35,030
First, I have a preliminary table like this.

184
00:30:43,060 --> 00:30:53,320
After getting the ELOC information, I will check whether any C module has Function equal to 0.

